       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd4ac6696548afc3d12a644dcdcb29df?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMR-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Mark Roy",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a5787f6180006a664a9f",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "2010-11-13T05:04:01.106-0400"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a5787f6180006a664a9f",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd4ac6696548afc3d12a644dcdcb29df?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMR-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd4ac6696548afc3d12a644dcdcb29df?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMR-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd4ac6696548afc3d12a644dcdcb29df?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMR-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd4ac6696548afc3d12a644dcdcb29df?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMR-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Mark Roy",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a5787f6180006a664a9f",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I've updated the rules in PolicyIndexInvocationHandler so that it now properly manages the cache.  It now will only proceed with the datastream rules iff the datastream being operated on is the FESLPOLICY stream.     Purging the policy stream also no longer necessarily deletes the policy from the cache; it checks after the delete is performed to see if there is still a policy and if so updates instead of deletes the policy.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The PolicyObject class also is modified so that if isPolicyActive() is called on an Object that does not have a FESLPOLICY stream, it returns false rather than throwing a null pointer exception.  isDatastreamActive() was also modified to return FALSE if the FESLPOLICY stream does not exist instead of throwing a null pointer exception.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "See the attached patches.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
